Note, checkboxes, radio groups, sliders, images and grid layout.
Note, press the button to read every widget value at once.

Open window with title Settings.
Set window size to 460 by 460.

Add label Choose your settings.
Add image logo from the file examples slash images slash logo.png.
Add checkbox agree with label I agree to the rules.
Add radio group difficulty with options Easy, Medium, Hard.
Add slider volume from 0 to 100.
Add button with text Show settings that calls show settings.
Add spacing 8 around all widgets.
Align label Choose your settings to the center.

Define show settings, do the following.
Let picked be the radio group difficulty.
Let loudness be the slider volume.
Let accepted be the checkbox agree.
Say the value of picked.
Say the value of loudness.
Say the value of accepted.
End define.

Wait for close.
